                                Parish church of St Mary Magdalen</orgName>
                            <p>Kalendar imperfect. On 6 November is added <q>Dedicacio ecclesie
                                    beate Marie Magdalene de flaunden in crastino die post festum
                                    sancti Leondardi perpetuis temporibus
                            duraturis(?)</q></p></provenance>
