                        <provenance type="MLGB3_LaterOwners">Sold to <persName>Meade
                                Falkner</persName> and in the Sotheby's sale of his library, 12
                            December 1932, lot 298 to <persName>J. H. Whitehouse</persName>
                            (£32).</provenance>
                        <provenance type="MLGB3_LaterOwners">Dawson's of Pall Mall, Catalogue 102
                            (1960), no. 5 with reduced facsimile of first leaf of Sanctorale
                            (£750).</provenance>
                        <provenance type="MLGB3_LaterOwners">The MLGB index card initially recorded
                            the current location of this book as Bembridge (Iowa), J. H. Whitehouse,
                            Yellowands. This was later changed to Urbana, University of
                            Illinois.</provenance>
